<title>UK: SOCCER-CAMEROON'S TCHAMI ON TRIAL WITH SUNDERLAND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMEROON'S TCHAMI ON TRIAL WITH SUNDERLAND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cameroon striker Alphonse Tchami will have a trial with English premier league Sunderland this week, Sunderland said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Tchami of Argentine first division club Boca Juniors, where he once played with Diego Maradona, is to join the squad on Thursday.</p>
